    <statement><p>Let <m>\mathbf{F}=\left\lt e^{2 y},\sin^{7} x, \cos^{9} x\right&gt;</m>.</p>
<p>Calculate <m>\text{curl}(\mathbf{F})</m>.</p>
<p><m>\text{curl}(\mathbf{F})=</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;0,9\cos^{8}\mathopen{}\left(x\right)\sin\mathopen{}\left(x\right),7\sin^{6}\mathopen{}\left(x\right)\cos\mathopen{}\left(x\right)-2e^{2y}\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><me>\text{curl}  (\mathbf{F}) =
